My last (and ascended) character, a [melee class] valkyrie, threw daggers;
roughly, she started with a couple of +0 daggers on one-dagger-per-turn
proficiency, switched to one +3 dagger and the former mentioned +0 stack,
enchanted the final stack (of 14 or so objects) to +3 (finally to +6), and
the skill went up to 1-3 daggers per turn. But she always used just a stack
of _six_ daggers (the rest was in the bag), not more. The daggers were of
great help even with the great Mjollnir in her hand.

